                                  Button, 0x106e2de00, {{0.0, 765.0}, {402.0, 230.3}}, identifier: 'archive.document.1', label: 'Stopping severe bleeding, Stopping severe bleeding > Step 3 - Tourniquet > Improvised tourniquets, A manufactured tourniquet is far better. If you have none:

- Use a strip of cloth at least **5 cm wide**. Anything narrower - rope, wire,
